{"4760900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Knock Off: The Battle For Imagination", "steam_appid": 4760900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/22d9d3684fbfc9bd88a337fac8268ae3.avif?t=1787335144\" alt=\"Old School Beat Down\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras_big/22d9d3684fbfc9bd88a337fac8268ae3.webp?t=1787335144 width=1560 height=509 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/4df4185aad3c6a0546079420f4ec0757.poster.avif?t=1787335144\" aria-label=\"Matty vs Fenix Fight\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/4df4185aad3c6a0546079420f4ec0757.webm?t=1787335144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/4df4185aad3c6a0546079420f4ec0757.mp4?t=1787335144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock Off is a fast-paced toy-box fighter set in a world of old-school action figures and retro attitude, where plastic warriors come to life and clash in stylized arenas inspired by classic ’80s and ’90s playtime mayhem. It delivers strategic matchups, distinct move sets, and skill-based combat, where every fighter brings their own strengths, weaknesses, techniques, and playstyle into the arena. The battle for imagination begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/e529e9df4760565e26d5297f1f467ad2.avif?t=1787335144\" alt=\"Action Figure Arcade Fighter\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras_big/e529e9df4760565e26d5297f1f467ad2.webp?t=1787335144 width=1560 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/7c7019e3f208484aa72e28c55d9e795c.poster.avif?t=1787335144\" aria-label=\"Kronan vs Wolfgang Fight\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/7c7019e3f208484aa72e28c55d9e795c.webm?t=1787335144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/7c7019e3f208484aa72e28c55d9e795c.mp4?t=1787335144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire up your imagination and fighting game skills in this fast-paced 2D fighter, inspired by the brilliant simplicity of classic arcade games and the tactile nostalgia of 80s/90s action figures. Master air combos, EX moves, assists, and super attacks with a roster of wild off-brand, off-kilter toy legends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/3fda7078f2e65bad04ec3f21a3a1533c.avif?t=1787335144\" alt=\"Return To A Simpler Time\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras_big/3fda7078f2e65bad04ec3f21a3a1533c.webp?t=1787335144 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/1151850e9b1309ed4377a0a42ce0844e.poster.avif?t=1787335144\" aria-label=\"Boy with toy Rayzenger\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/1151850e9b1309ed4377a0a42ce0844e.webm?t=1787335144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/1151850e9b1309ed4377a0a42ce0844e.mp4?t=1787335144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His toys were never name brand… but they were always legendary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may have been bootleg bargains, but in Johnny's mind, his toys are all legends! When Maximus, Johnny’s first official brand name action figure, arrives and shakes up the arena, Johnny’s beloved bootleg toys must prove that off-brand doesn’t mean outmatched. Fighters from rival off-brand toy lines collide in fast-paced VS combat in arenas shaped by a kid’s unrivaled imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/e42bbc5ed076e4818c27b928fe414b9b.avif?t=1787335144\" alt=\"Features\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras_big/e42bbc5ed076e4818c27b928fe414b9b.webp?t=1787335144 width=1560 height=389 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/a694ae33ead4d9b4c3fc09dcc3f96c05.poster.avif?t=1787335144\" aria-label=\"Rayzenger vs Grimrot Fight\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/a694ae33ead4d9b4c3fc09dcc3f96c05.webm?t=1787335144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extras/a694ae33ead4d9b4c3fc09dcc3f96c05.mp4?t=1787335144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 2D combat with air combos, launchers, EX moves, assists, and spectacular supers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a team of dedicated fighting game veterans with a focus on competitive fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to play, challenging to master – jump into a casual match, or train for a serious tournament</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters with rich move sets, fun assist sidekicks, and deep fighting mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode: Choose your fighter and take on a gauntlet of opponents in an arcade-style single-player mode with a fully voiced narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >State-of-the-art online play, with rollback netcode, customizable matchmaking, and global ranking systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roster inspired by classic ‘80s and ‘90s toy lines and cartoons – and the knock-offs they inspired</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic battle arenas packed with retro references and hidden Easter eggs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique fighters with handcrafted playstyles and fictional toy-line lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable retro-inspired arcade beat 'em up minigame with classic side-scrolling action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned roster expansions with new fighters, special guest characters, new stages and much, much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn up the fight with an original soundtrack by Celldweller and Scandroid, packed with high-energy tracks inspired by the sounds of the ‘80s and ‘90s.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760900/extr